DESCRIPTION:For several Dutch municipalities\, Django applications power th
 e monitoring of both on-street and off-street parking transactions. What s
 tarted as a straightforward tool for extracting data from parking faciliti
 es has evolved into a robust ETL platform with a feature-rich dashboard. T
 his talk delves into how Django remains the backbone of our operations and
  why it continues to be the foundation of our business success.
